WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:08.000
Day 2, Month of Closna Imperial Year 952

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.010
(no translation)

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.180
A long, long time ago...

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:29.540
...when the solar system was the only home of humankind...

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:34.940
...unusual particles of great mass and energy were discovered.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:40.860
However, nobody knew what the source of the energy was.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.260
Maybe it was a white hole.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.860
Or perhaps something from a different dimension or space.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.500
One theory was that a hole opened up in the wall...

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.500
...that separates this universe from another.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.900
These theories were no more than superstitions...

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:58.010
...falling far short of being hypothetical.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.970
Yet research on the use of this energy continued.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.870
Eventually, this new energy source...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.480
...allowed humans to emigrate beyond the solar system.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:16.690
Humanity then spread across the whole galaxy.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:19.110
Uanon Propulsion lnterstellar
Immigration Vessel, Leif Erikson

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:56.930
Inofacssoth

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:56.930
Invasion

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:04.600
Planet Martinh

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.590
The Landing

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.590
 Day 57, First Season, Year 172

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.650
Space Defense System Control Room

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.220
Why didn't the alarm go off?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.760
I have no idea. They just suddenly appeared.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.810
Where did it come from?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.810
Erikson 2 is entering the intercept course.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.330
Disappeared?!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.370
All right.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.410
Get everyone together.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.040
That's right.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:56.920
But...

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.420
Don't mention the defense system until after the investigation.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.840
Don't discuss it.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.760
That's right! Not with anyone!

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.650
My beloved home planet...

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:16.690
...Martine.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.610
However...

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:23.110
...was there really a time when I missed my home planet?

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.570
Ever?

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.200
Don't, Jinto.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.910
You mustn't open it.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.580
You're letting the wind in.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:34.750
Hey.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.370
Look, Lina.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.960
What's that?

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.160
Entering Saudec in 10 seconds.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.330
You look worried, Commander.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.970
It's work that's far, far short on glory.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.390
Five, four...

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.970
...three, two, one.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.210
The Landing

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.210
Day 81, First Season, Year 172

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:44.280
<i>This is an evacuation order.</i>

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.400
<i>All civilians are to follow instructions given by officials...</i>

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.950
<i>...and proceed to the designated area in your neighborhood.</i>

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.200
Wait!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.330
<i>This is an evacuation order...</i>

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.490
<i>All civilians are to follow instructions given by officials...</i>

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.160
Jinto!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.250
Jinto!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.750
<i>The invading fleet...</i>

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.250
<i>...has declared its national identity.</i>

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.010
<i>They are...</i>

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.920
<i>...the Humankind Empire Abh.</i>

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.510
<i>The Hyde system government...</i>

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:14.930
<i>...has offered to negotiate an alliance treaty with them.</i>

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.640
<i>However, the commander of the invading army...</i>

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:20.100
<i>...has rejected this offer...</i>

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:24.360
<i>...and we're told he will be making an official announcement.</i>

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.470
Presidential Residence

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:38.120
<i>We have confirmation that</i> <i>an official announcement...</i>

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.750
<i>...by the invading commander...</i>

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.290
<i>...will be broadcast from the</i> <i>flagship of the invading fleet.</i>

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.000
Their commander is a diplomat...

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:47.460
...in addition to serving in the military.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.840
And apparently he's also the Crown Prince of the Abh.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.090
What's he like?

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.300
Don't be surprised when you see him.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.220
Nothing to be concerned about.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.520
To put it bluntly...

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.060
...he looks like some kind of harmless elf.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:02.600
Look...

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.150
...there he is.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:13.160
<i>I'd like to begin by outlining the nature of the relationship between our Empire and you.</i>

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.160
These people, I've been told...

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.370
...apparently never get old...

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.410
...and that all the men and women are beautiful.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.960
According to them, they're descended from Earthlings.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:25.170
They've just made some adjustments to their genes.

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:27.300
Adjustments, huh?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.050
<i>Firstly, my will and that of the Empire are one and the same.</i>

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:35.550
<i>At least as far as you are concerned.</i>

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.350
<i>A noble will be appointed to your system.</i>

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:46.440
<i>For the time being, our Empress will be your lady.</i>

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:52.240
Needless to say, the Empress has numerous duties...

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:57.240
...so a magistrate will be appointed to your system.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.540
In any case, a ruler or magistrate normally...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.000
...does not get involved in the details.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:08.710
<i>The reason for this...</i>

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.710
<i>...is that we feel that governing your world...</i>

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:16.180
<i>...is the furthest thing from being elegant.</i>

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.510
How dare he!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.520
So, this is a threat!

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.400
They say that, depending on our response...

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.030
...they won't hesitate to destroy this planet.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.490
They rule over 1,500 inhabited star systems...

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.910
...and another 20,000 partially inhabited star systems?

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.910
Are you suggesting we fight such a powerful Empire?

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.620
But that's only what they're telling us, isn't it?

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:42.370
That's right!

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:44.500
Anyone who believes in what the invader says...

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.620
...should get his head examined.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.040
We might have a chance against them on land.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.040
That's crazy!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.010
Is it right to surrender without putting up a fight?

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.800
You think too much about how you'd look on election day!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.010
Be quiet!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:57.430
This is no time to bicker!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:01.560
Our Space Defense System was built just for something like this.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.600
How can we expect to fight...

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:10.520
...with a mere ten lasers and 20 missiles?!

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.740
This is a question of national honor!

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.030
What is the opinion of the Department of Facilities?

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.410
Well, uh...

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.040
...what we feel is...

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.410
...you see...

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:37.730
Rock Lynn

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:37.730
President of Planet Martine, Hyde Star System

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:45.100
<i>This door is closed due to an emergency.</i>

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.560
<i>I had no idea...</i>

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.390
<i>...back then...</i>

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:52.310
<i>...on that day.</i>

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.460
The Landing

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.460
Day 87, First Season, Year 172

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:04.630
The Martine Government

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:04.630
Surrenders to the Abh Empire

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.630
Seven years later...

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:39.070
<i>The Lengarf Glorf, bound for Estote State...</i>

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.900
<i>...is scheduled to depart at 17:30.</i>

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.820
<i>Was this place always like this?</i>

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.000
<i>It's no wonder, dressed the way I am.</i>

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:59.790
Hey, Dad!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:00.380
Huh?

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.840
This is really good!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:13.600
<i>I don't clearly remember the day I came here 7 years ago.</i>

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:17.850
<i>I couldn't comprehend what was going on.</i>

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.560
<i>It was just...</i>

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.070
<i>...so exhilarating.</i>

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:27.570
Jinto.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.290
Till...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.080
What are you doing here?

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.250
I've been looking for you.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.910
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.330
I'll return right away.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.210
Don't bother!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.330
Just come.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.090
Where are we going?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:43.800
The presidential residence.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.470
To Father's place?

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:47.800
Why are we going there?

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.300
Just come with me.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:52.720
But, wait...

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.230
Wait a minute.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.100
We've got no time. Hurry up!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.480
Um, are you angry with me?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.150
I'll apologize then. So...

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.870
Teal...

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.170
Can we win against them?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.800
There is no win or lose.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.510
There is no war.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.800
Did we surrender then?

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.090
That's right!

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.680
Your father decided to surrender.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.230
No, more accurately...

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:38.980
...your father sold us out.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.270
Sold us out?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:41.940
What do you mean by that?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:44.520
Rock, that bastard, made a deal with them.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.280
A really bad deal.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.240
Made a deal?

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.700
Stop repeating me like a parrot!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.320
I'm sorry.

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:58.040
Sure, I was also against starting a war.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.500
But I can't believe he'd make such a deal!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:02.960
Damn him.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.540
I've lost respect for him.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.090
I apologize.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:12.220
None of this is your fault.

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.010
What...

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:17.350
What is happening?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.350
I don't understand what's going on.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.560
Right. I suppose.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.690
Rock made a deal.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.690
I already told you that.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.740
There'll be an announcement about it soon.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.410
Everyone will then find out how he betrayed us all.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:33.740
Betrayed us?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.620
And you're his son.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.910
That's why you have to hide out in the Presidential Residence.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.710
So that you won't be caught and get beaten up.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.960
Is somebody going to beat me up?

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.710
Or they'll throw smoke bombs through your window.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:51.090
Then what'll happen to Lina?

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.800
Many people know that I'm living with you, Till.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:57.470
You're right.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.770
I've already contacted her.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:01.890
Lina's an adult...

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.730
...so she'll be able to take care of herself.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.560
You mean she already evacuated?

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.940
Yeah.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.030
But she was worried about you.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:13.570
I assured her that I'd look for you.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:16.780
I see.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.410
And...

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.830
...what do you mean by "a deal"?

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:24.960
That's a secret.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:29.920
Nobody is supposed to know about it until the announcement.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.300
Not even me?

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:32.720
Well, well...

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.180
Already acting like one of the privileged class.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.470
What do you mean?

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:37.970
Turn on the holo.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.810
They'll be making the announcement.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:45.850
<i>So far, the Abh have made no moves.</i>

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.150
<i>It seems there were talks held...</i>

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:51.110
<i>...between President Lynn and the invading army.</i>

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.570
<i>According to a source...</i>

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:56.360
<i>...a decision has been made to surrender to the Empire.</i>

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.780
<i>We can only hope that these rumors are false.</i>

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:02.620
<i>We've been informed that an important announcement...</i>

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.040
<i>...will take place at 25 o'clock at the presidential residence.</i>

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.670
<i>That's 1 minute from now.</i>

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:12.340
<i>It was a very long minute.</i>

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.000
<i>We are announcing our decision.</i>

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:50.920
<i>Today, at 23:52, President Rock Lynn...</i>

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:54.000
<i>...of the Hyde system government...</i>

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:58.050
<i>...has informed Prince and Commander of the fleet...</i>

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:02.560
<i>...Lord Ablïarsec néïc Lamsar Larth Barcœr Dusanh...</i>

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:06.680
<i>...of his decision to relinquish authority over the Hyde system.</i>

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.230
<i>As of this day...</i>

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:12.900
<i>...we are subjects of the Humankind Empire Abh.</i>

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.570
I knew it.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.860
There's more.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.490
<i>As a compromise, the President made a request which...</i>

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:24.740
<i>...would allow the citizens of the Hyde system...</i>

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.910
<i>...to make use of the routes to other star systems.</i>

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.000
<i>In other words...</i>

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.080
<i>...the request is that our master be chosen within this system.</i>

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.590
<i>Is that possible?!</i>

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:36.800
<i>Our conqueror has agreed to this on condition that...</i>

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:40.340
<i>...he be given the codes to the Space Defense System.</i>

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:45.850
I didn't know the Abh had concerns about our defenses.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:48.520
We might've had a chance against them.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.270
<i>So who's our new master?!</i>

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.810
<i>We're not taking questions yet.</i>

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.400
<i>Who's our new master?!</i>

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:55.110
<i>Tell us who our master will be!</i>

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:57.900
Who is our new master?!

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:58.780
Damn!

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.860
I already know, and so does everyone else.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:04.410
But we still want them to clearly tell us!

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.370
Give us the name of our new master!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.330
This can't be true, can it?

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.460
<i>All right.</i>

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.000
<i>It's who you all think it is.</i>

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:20.630
<i>Rock Lynn will rule our star system...</i>

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:21.800
That's right.

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.430
Rock is the new master.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:27.060
That's the bad deal your father made with them.

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:30.270
And he didn't even consult me about it.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.980
I guess he had no use for a mere executive secretary.

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:37.820
I guess the best I can do is just take his son to a safe place.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.690
I always thought we were good friends!

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:40.400
<i>Don't be ridiculous!</i>

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:41.650
<i>You traitor!
Don't be ridiculous!</i>

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.740
<i>And where is the President, or, rather...</i>

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.530
<i>...Lord Lynn at this moment?</i>

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.240
That's right, where is he?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.370
Well...

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:53.170
<i>...Rock Lynn is already on their ship headed for his...</i>

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.250
<i>...official ennoblement in the imperial capital.</i>

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:57.880
He's run away!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.260
So, that's why he delayed this announcement.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.840
I wonder if he'll return.

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:03.680
I'm sure he will.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.720
Surrounded by guards of the Imperial Army.

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:07.760
No.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:10.470
He couldn't return even if he wanted to.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:14.150
You can't expect the Empire to easily give him a title.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.110
He's being tricked himself.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.150
Serves him right!

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:20.030
<i>I ask that you all...</i>

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.530
So that makes you the next in line as lord.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:28.410
Oh, I really should be speaking to you with more respect.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:31.290
You are our Prince after all.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.620
Please forgive me for my rudeness, Your Excellency.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.830
I ask for your pardon.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.840
That's not fair, Till.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.550
Why are you talking to me like that?

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:45.590
I know.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.550
I'm not treating you fairly.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.260
However...

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:52.060
...I'm having trouble coping with the situation.

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.390
Damn!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:56.100
I'm trying my best not to lose control of myself.

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.020
But...

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.400
Damn!

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:02.690
Till.

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:05.450
Tell me just one thing.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:06.950
What is it?

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:11.200
When you told Lina to run away...

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.000
...did you tell her about the deal?

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.290
No.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:18.380
Because it was a secret to the general public.

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:21.590
I see...

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>That day...</i>

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:28.390
<i>...I lost my home.</i>

00:22:29.100 --> 00:22:30.640
<i>My home...</i>

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:31.720
<i>...and...</i>

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:34.810
<i>...perhaps my family as well.</i>

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:46.450
<i>I came to this planet to go to school and learn about the Abh.</i>

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.780
<i>I'll now go to the capital to attend military school.</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:52.450
<i>However...</i>

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:57.210
<i>...I still have never met an Abh.</i>

00:22:58.370 --> 00:22:59.630
<i>Actually...</i>

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>...today will be the first time.</i>

00:24:30.470 --> 00:24:32.720
Your Excellency Linn ssynec Rocr Ïarlucec Dreuc Haïder Jintoo.

00:24:32.760 --> 00:24:35.100
Aren't you going home?

00:24:39.730 --> 00:24:41.190
Just a minute.

00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:43.730
There aren't any beautiful cabin attendants...

00:24:43.810 --> 00:24:45.360
...but there is an elegant pilot.

00:24:52.110 --> 00:24:53.570
Are you going already?

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:56.830
You shall call me Lafiel!

00:24:56.970 --> 00:24:59.850
Next Episode

00:24:56.970 --> 00:24:59.850
Kin of the Stars

00:24:56.970 --> 00:24:59.850
Carsarh Gerélacr
